1
00:00:00,800 --> 00:00:04,200
In Haizhou, the city's heart
changes beat at 4:17 every morning.

2
00:00:05,500 --> 00:00:08,700
For twenty-two years, I've
kept the night shift.

3
00:00:16,400 --> 00:00:18,200
Don't forget the nine o'clock.

4
00:00:18,400 --> 00:00:19,200
I won't.

5
00:00:25,300 --> 00:00:27,500
Tonight is the last time.

6
00:00:28,300 --> 00:00:30,800
I heard tonight's the
last manual handover.

7
00:00:31,000 --> 00:00:31,900
The last one.

8
00:00:32,100 --> 00:00:33,800
But machines don't remember you.

9
00:00:34,300 --> 00:00:37,300
Tomorrow, there'll be no one here.

10
00:00:38,400 --> 00:00:42,400
She gave this city a new brain.
And replaced me with it.

11
00:00:43,300 --> 00:00:45,700
Xiao Chen, the new system
switched early. Watch it.

12
00:00:45,900 --> 00:00:46,700
Who authorized it?

13
00:00:46,900 --> 00:00:47,900
The system did.

14
00:00:48,300 --> 00:00:49,500
Is Engineer Lin there?

15
00:00:49,700 --> 00:00:50,400
No.

16
00:01:05,300 --> 00:01:08,100
All city signals down! Repeat,
all city signals down!

17
00:01:08,300 --> 00:01:08,800
No.

18
00:01:10,400 --> 00:01:13,000
Xiao Chen, manual reboot.
Only you can do it.

19
00:01:13,300 --> 00:01:14,100
I'm on my way.

20
00:01:15,200 --> 00:01:18,000
Twenty-two years on this route.
First time it felt this long.

21
00:01:22,500 --> 00:01:23,700
Why are you here?

22
00:01:32,400 --> 00:01:34,200
My system failed.

23
00:01:34,500 --> 00:01:36,500
My city failed too.

24
00:01:37,400 --> 00:01:38,800
You brought the key?

25
00:01:39,100 --> 00:01:41,100
Twenty-two years. Never changed it.

26
00:01:42,400 --> 00:01:43,600
I brought the override.

27
00:01:43,900 --> 00:01:45,100
Then together.

28
00:01:47,300 --> 00:01:48,800
You still write by hand?

29
00:01:49,000 --> 00:01:50,500
Machines don't remember. I do.

30
00:01:51,200 --> 00:01:51,900
Like what?

31
00:01:52,100 --> 00:01:53,300
Like today.

32
00:01:55,200 --> 00:01:56,800
Relay 047, manual lock.

33
00:01:57,000 --> 00:01:58,200
047. The old problem.

34
00:01:59,300 --> 00:02:00,700
You left it a note?

35
00:02:00,900 --> 00:02:02,500
I did. 'Don't quit in the rain.'

36
00:02:02,700 --> 00:02:03,600
It listens to you.

37
00:02:03,800 --> 00:02:04,800
It has for eighteen years.

38
00:02:05,200 --> 00:02:08,000
That year, you gave me the
umbrella and stood in the rain.

39
00:02:08,100 --> 00:02:09,600
The red light was
especially long that day.

40
00:02:09,620 --> 00:02:12,000
You said a long red light was
enough to decide a lifetime.

41
00:02:12,200 --> 00:02:13,400
You're still like this.

42
00:02:13,600 --> 00:02:14,300
Like what?

43
00:02:14,500 --> 00:02:15,900
When you're fixing something,
nothing else exists.

44
00:02:16,300 --> 00:02:17,100
You too.

45
00:02:17,300 --> 00:02:18,000
I changed.

46
00:02:18,200 --> 00:02:19,000
How?

47
00:02:19,200 --> 00:02:20,900
I set the launch time for 4:17.

48
00:02:21,200 --> 00:02:22,000
Why?

49
00:02:22,200 --> 00:02:24,200
I wanted you to see it run without you.

50
00:02:24,400 --> 00:02:25,200
Did it?

51
00:02:25,400 --> 00:02:25,900
No.

52
00:02:26,200 --> 00:02:27,100
Neither did I.

53
00:02:27,300 --> 00:02:30,300
I said you guarded this city
like someone who'd never answer.

54
00:02:30,500 --> 00:02:31,200
Cities don't leave.

55
00:02:31,400 --> 00:02:32,000
I did.

56
00:02:32,200 --> 00:02:33,000
You left.

57
00:02:33,200 --> 00:02:34,100
I came back.

58
00:02:35,200 --> 00:02:35,900
Press it.

59
00:02:36,100 --> 00:02:36,700
Together.

60
00:02:53,300 --> 00:02:55,300
4:21. The city rebooted.

61
00:02:56,700 --> 00:02:58,100
It took four minutes seventeen seconds.

62
00:02:58,300 --> 00:02:59,800
We took eighteen years.

63
00:03:00,300 --> 00:03:01,100
Nine o'clock.

64
00:03:01,300 --> 00:03:01,700
Mm.

65
00:03:02,000 --> 00:03:02,800
Are you going?

66
00:03:03,100 --> 00:03:03,900
Are you?

67
00:03:05,300 --> 00:03:07,100
Will the new system keep the old data?

68
00:03:07,400 --> 00:03:09,600
Yes. Otherwise it wouldn't know the way.

69
00:03:10,200 --> 00:03:11,000
And us?

70
00:03:11,200 --> 00:03:12,100
The key is yours.

71
00:03:12,300 --> 00:03:12,800
Together.

72
00:03:13,000 --> 00:03:13,600
Mm. Together.
